case, the state as I said the state

00:05:00.400 --> 00:05:02.230
block outline that I drew is actually

00:05:02.240 --> 00:05:04.470
understood and not drawn specifically

00:05:04.480 --> 00:05:06.830
explicitly. And this

00:05:06.840 --> 00:05:08.950
already we have enough to synthesize

00:05:08.960 --> 00:05:11.150
simple fixed function sequences or

00:05:11.160 --> 00:05:13.190
counters if you want with state output

00:05:13.200 --> 00:05:14.830
such as ring counters. Here I've on the

00:05:14.840 --> 00:05:16.470
