00:07:01.560 --> 00:07:03.150
which says conditional immediate output

00:07:03.160 --> 00:07:04.110
list.

00:07:04.120 --> 00:07:06.870
So, these depend on the current state

00:07:06.880 --> 00:07:10.030
we're in and the inputs, right?

00:07:10.040 --> 00:07:11.710
They're still part of the current state,

00:07:11.720 --> 00:07:12.950
but they're they're a function of the

